!.gitignore
.zig-cache/
zig-out/

# Runtime output, not source: the default room log a plain `rekarma` run writes
# into the cwd (--file puts it anywhere else), and the two files `rekarma --daemon`
# keeps next to it — its own output and its pid.
/all.txt
/all.txt.log
/all.txt.pid

# `rekarma --magnet` writes its pieces here by default (--cache changes it), plus
# the daemon's log and pid file when the mount is detached.
/.rekarma/

# vendor/ is generated, never committed: scripts/fetch-librats.sh builds librats
# from source per target triple (search features ON, so bittorrent/--magnet
# works) and scripts/fetch-fuse3.sh builds libfuse3 the same way. install.sh
# calls both. Run them once after a clone, before `zig build`.
/vendor/
